[[Ulundrupet]] - [[Kallakkurichchi]] - [[ Chinnasalem]] - [[Attur]] - [[Pethanaickenpalayam]] - [[Vazhapadi]]<nowiki> - [[Salem, Tamil Nadu|Salem])</nowiki>\n|junction=  \n}}\n\u0022'National Highway 79\u0022' (NH 79) is a [[National Highway (India)|National Highway]] in [[India]] entirely within the state of [[Tamil Nadu]]. It runs between [[Ulundurpettai]] and [[Salem, Tamil Nadu|Salem]] in the [[India]]n state of [[Tamil Nadu]] for a total of  
 . It connects with [[National Highway 44 (India)|NH 44]] and [[National Highway 544|NH 544]] at Salem. NH 79 connects [[National Highway 68|NH 68]] and SH 69 at Ulundurpettai. It was upgraded to a [[dual carriageway]] road in two phases on a [[Build-operate-transfer]] basis by [[Reliance Infrastructure]] and [[Maytas]].\n\n== Traffic ==\nNH 79is an important connecting road for vehicles travelling from the two major cities Coimbatore and Kochi. NH 79 connects [[Salem, Tamil Nadu|Salem]], in directly [[Coimbatore]], [[Erode]], [[Tirupur]] and the cities around these areas with [[Chennai]].\n\n== Route ==\n[[Ulundurpettai]] - Elavanasur - ThiyagaDurgam - [[Kallakurichi]] - [[Chinnasalem]], [[Thalaivasal]] - Kattukottai -  [[Attur]] - [[Pethanaickenpalayam]] - [[Vazhapadi]] - [[Salem, Tamil Nadu|Salem]]\n\n== Gallery ==\n\n<gallery>\nFile:A national highway.JPG|NH 79 near [[Kallakurichi]] in [[Villupuram district]], [[Tamil Nadu]].\nFile:A Chinna Salem-Kallakurichi national highway.JPG|NH 79 near Kallakurichi, [[Villupuram district]], [[Tamil Nadu]]\n</gallery>\n\n== See also ==\n*[[National Highways Development Project]]\n\n== References ==\n{{Reflist}}\n\n[[Category:National Highways in Tamil Nadu|79]]\n[[Category:Indian National Highways]]\n\n{{india-road-stub}}\n{{Indian Highways Network}}</text>\n      <sha1>qzva2wlluhbje1q61uhyg9nd3vfdmx8</sha1>\n    </revision>\n  </page>\n  <page>\n    <title>Category:1993 Italian television series debuts</title>\n    <ns>14</ns>\n    <id>44397335</id>\n    <revision>\n      <id>633792691</id>\n      <timestamp>2014-11-14T10:24:51Z</timestamp>\n      <contributor>\n        <username>Hugo999</username>\n        <id>3006008</id>\n      </contributor>\n      <comment>Created page with '{{Year by category | m = 1 | c = 9 | d = 9 | y = 3 | cat = Italian television series debuts | sortkey = Italian television series debuts | in =  | parent = Itali...'</comment>\n      <model>wikitext</model>\n      <format>text/x-wiki</format>\n    