{{Medal|Sport | Men's [[Athletics (sport)|Athletics]]}}\n{{Medal|Country | {{NZL}} }}\n{{Medal|Comp|[[Athletics at the Commonwealth Games|Commonwealth Games]]}}\n{{Medal|Gold|[[1966 Commonwealth Games|1966 Kingston]]|
