 (15 st 1 lb, 211 lb)\n| ru_position = [[Centre (rugby union)|Centre]], [[Wing (rugby union)|Wing]], [[Fullback (rugby union)|Fullback]]\n| ru_clubupdate =\n| ru_proclubs = \n| ru_clubyears =\n| ru_province = [[Ulster Rugby|Ulster]]\n| ru_provinceyears = 2015–\n| ru_provincecaps = 18\n| ru_provincepoints = (35) \n| ru_provinceupdate = 26 February 2017\n| ru_nationalyears = 2014-2016\n| ru_nationalteam = [[Ireland national under-20 rugby union team|Ireland U20]]\n| ru_nationalcaps = 13\n| ru_nationalpoints = (30)\n| ru_ntupdate = \n| other = \n| spouse =\n| children =\n| siblings =\n| school = \n| university = \n}}\n\n\u0022'Jacob Stockdale\u0022' (born 3 April 1996) is an [[Ireland|Irish]] professional [[rugby union]] player who currently plays for [[Ulster Rugby|Ulster]]. He played for [[Ireland national under-20 rugby union team|Ireland U20]] at the 2015 & 2016 editions of the [[World Rugby Under 20 Championship]]\n\nAlways marked out as a teenage player of quality in 2014, while at Wallace High School, he was voted Dankse Bank Ulster Schools Player of the Year. The wing-come-centre has represented Ireland Under 
, and made his debut for the senior Ulster side as an 19-year-old in 2015. A graduate of the Hughes Insurance Ulster Rugby Academy and Ulster A team, Jacob has firmly established himself in the senior squad and is justifiably in a star-laden pool of backs. His forceful running and eye for the try-line seem to a guarantee a long future in the Ulster jersey. On the 17th May 2017 he was named in the Ireland squad for the summer tour.\n\n==References==\n{{Reflist}}\n\n==External links==\n*[http://www.ulsterrugby.com/team/player.php?PlayId=118708#.WLLqVhBsSwk Ulster Rugby Profile]\n*[http://www.irishrugby.ie/rugby/fixturesandresults/squads_ireland_u20.php?player=118708&includeref=dynamic Ireland U20 Profile]\n\n{{Ulster Rugby squad}}\n\n{{DEFAULTSORT:Stockdale, Jacob}}\n[[Category:1996 births]]\n[[Category:Living people]]\n[[Category:Irish rugby union players]]\n[[Category:Rugby union centres]]\n[[Category:Ulster Rugby players]]\n\n\n{{Ireland-rugbyunion-bio-stub}}</text>\n      <sha1>6vfoui0w8csjph3x842mjjvcjftrgjr</sha1>\n    </revision>\n  </page>\n  <page>\n    <title>Category:Criticisms of programming languages</title>\n    <ns>14</ns>\n    <id>53316451</id>\n    <revision>\n      <id>767543596</id>\n      <timestamp>2017-02-26T15:03:31Z</timestamp>\n      <contributor>\n        <username>Apokrif</username>\n        <id>173030</id>\n      </contributor>\n      <comment>Created page with '[[Category:Criticisms of software and websites]] [[Category:Programming languages]]'</comment>\n      <model>wikitext</model>\n      <format>text/x-wiki</format>\n      <text xml:space=\u0022preserve\u0022>[[Category:Criticisms of software and websites]]\n[[Category:Programming languages]]</text>\n      <sha1>s3hab01p02xohc94x8xjn4qqyvgg
</sha1>\n    </revision>\n  </page>\n  <page>\n    <title>Burnley cup</title>\n    <ns>0</ns>\n    <id>53316456</id>\n    <redirect title=\u0022Burnley Cup\u0022 />\n    <revision>\n      <id>767543615</id>\n      <timestamp>2017-02-26T15:03:38Z</timestamp>\n      <contributor>\n        <username>Bandar perda</username>\n        <id>19279959</id>\n      </contributor>\n      <comment>Bandar perda moved page [[Burnley cup]] to [[Burnley Cup]]</comment>\n      <model>wikitext</model>\n      <format>text/x-wiki</format>\n      <text xml:space=\u0022preserve\u0022>#REDIRECT [[Burnley Cup]]\n\n{{R from move}}</text>\n      <sha1>9a3lp3d4p7h0g3l4q7ic0dzvnporpdx</sha1>\n    </revision>\n  </page>\n  <page>\n    <title>H. T. Ellacombe</title>\n    <ns>0</ns>\n    <id>53316462</id>\n    <redirect title=\u0022Henry Thomas Ellacombe\u0022 />\n    <revision>\n      <id>767543711</id>\n      <timestamp>2017-02-26T15:04:19Z</timestamp>\n      <contributor>\n        <username>DuncanHill</username>\n        <id>1739907<
