|West Ham United]] \n|align=center|[[2015–16 Under-21 Premier League Cup#Final|1 – 1]]{{asterisk}}\n|align=left|[[Hull City A.F.C.|Hull City]]\n|\u0022West Ham United won 5-3 on penalties\u0022\n|-\n|[[2016–17 Premier League Cup|2016-17]]\n|align=right|[[Reading F.C.| Reading]]\n|align=center|[[2016–17 Premier League Cup#Final|0 – 2]]{{asterisk}}\n|align=left|[[Swansea City| Swansea]]\n|}\n{{asterisk}} - [[Two-legged tie|aggregate score]]\n\n==Records==\n*\u0022'Record attendance:\u0022'  \n**12,356\n[[Southampton F.C.|Southampton]] vs. [[Blackburn Rovers F.C.|Blackburn Rovers]], Final second leg, 20 April 2015\n*\u0022'Record win:\u0022'\n**7 - 0\n[[Brighton & Hove Albion]] vs. [[Nottingham Forest]], Group Stage, 1 October 2016\n*\u0022'Highest scoring game:\u0022' \n**10 goals\n[[Norwich City F.C.|Norwich City]] 5 - 5 [[Fulham F.C.|Fulham]], Round of 16, 17 March 2017\n\n==See also==\n*[[FA Cup]]\n*[[FA Youth Cup]]\n*[[Professional Development League]]\n\n==References==\n{{reflist}}\n\n==External links==\n\n{{Premier League Cup}}\n{{Reserve and Youth football in England}}\n\n[[Category:Recurring sporting events established in 2013]]\n[[Category:Youth football cup competitions in England]]\n[[Category:Premier League Cup| ]]\n[[Category:2013 establishments in England]]\n[[Category:Premier League|Cup]]</text>\n      <sha1>92ufov6wkm3y2ww9inbsewh4nmtdtzb</sha1>\n    </revision>\n  </page>\n  <page>\n    <title>Gillian Adams</title>\n    <ns>0</ns>\n    <id>40478989</id>\n    <redirect title=\u0022Gillian Horovitz\u0022 />\n    <revision>\n      <id>572084244</id>\n      <timestamp>2013-09-08T18:12:40Z</timestamp>\n      <contributor>\n        <username>Sillyfolkboy</username>\n        <id>6935794</id>\n      </contributor>\n      <comment>redirect from alt name</comment>\n      <model>wikitext</model>\n      <format>text/x-wiki</format>\n      <text xml:space=\u0022preserve\u0022>#REDIRECT [[Gillian Horovitz]]</text>\n      <sha1>112u8p4cgfln9387ih9zf3ak7qliegu</sha1>