* \u0022'[[County Galway]]\u0022'\n** [[Williamstown, County Galway|Williamstown]] - [\u0022Starts at junction with the\u0022 [[R360 road (Ireland)|R360]]  \n* \u0022'[[County Roscommon]]\u0022'\n** \u0022Trien\u0022\n** [[Castlerea]] - [[N60 road (Ireland)|N60]] - \u0022crosses the [[River Suck]]\u0022\n** ([[R325 road (Ireland)|R325]])\n** \u0022Cloonsheever\u0022 \n** [[Frenchpark]] - ([[N5 road (Ireland)|N5]])\n** ([[R370 road (Ireland)|R370]])\n** \u0022Killerdoo\u0022\n** [[Boyle, County Roscommon|Boyle]] – \u0022terminates at junction with the \u0022 [[N61 road (Ireland)|N61]] \n}}\n\n\nThe \u0022'R361 road\u0022' is a [[regional road]] mainly in [[County Roscommon]], [[Republic of Ireland|Ireland]]. South to north the route connects [[Williamstown, County Galway|Williamstown]] to [[Boyle, County Roscommon|Boyle]]. \n\nThe road starts in [[County Galway]] for the first 
 and in County Roscommon for the rest of the route, which is  
  long.\n\n==See also==\n*[[Roads in Ireland]]\n*[[National primary road]]\n*[[National secondary road]]\n\n==References==\n*[http://www.transport.ie/upload/general/7617-0.pdf Roads Act 1993 (Classification of Regional Roads) Order 2006] – [[Department of Transport, Tourism and Sport|Department of Transport]]\n\n{{Roads in Ireland}}\n\n[[Category:Regional roads in the Republic of Ireland]]\n[[Category:Roads in County Roscommon]]</text>\n      <sha1>8vjqkemrdjk0ta61ls721v1f3v47b
</sha1>\n    </revision>\n  </page>\n  <page>\n    <title>Batzar Nagusiak</title>\n    <ns>0</ns>\n    <id>25072742</id>\n    <redirect title=\u0022Juntas Generales\u0022 />\n    <revision>\n      <id>642867195</id>\n      <parentid>325701631</parentid>\n      <timestamp>2015-01-17T04:58:18Z</timestamp>\n      <contributor>\n        <username>Menchi</username>\n        <id>6153</id>\n      </contributor>\n      <minor />\n      <comment>determine redirection lang</comment>\n      <model>wikitext</model>\n      <format>text/x-wiki</format>\n      <text xml:space=\u0022preserve\u0022>#REDIRECT [[Juntas Generales]] {{R from alternative language|eu|es}}</text>\n      <sha1>mvlttvdx3yu5vsb72m054oqln7iejne</sha1>\n    </revision>\n  </page>\n  <page>\n    <title>Richard Klein (TV)</title>\n    <ns>0</ns>\n    <id>25072743</id>\n    <revision>\n      <id>752272097</id>\n      <parentid>741151475</parentid>\n      <timestamp>2016-11-30T11:03:56Z</timestamp>\n      <contributor>\n        <username>Bender the Bot</username>\n        <id>28903366</id>\n      </contributor>\n      <minor />\n      <comment>/* Video clips */clean up; http→https for [[YouTube]] using [[Project:AWB|AWB]]</comment>\n      <model>wikitext</model>\n      <format>text/x-wiki</format>\n      <text xml:space=\u0022preserve\u0022>{{Use dmy dates|date=July 2013}}\n{{Infobox person\n| name =  Richard Klein\n| image =\n| caption =\n| birth_date =  1958-10-12 }}\n| birth_place = [[Burwash Common]], [[Sussex]]\n| birth_name = Richard Henry Klein\n| death_date =\n| death_place =\n| death_cause =\n| known =\n| occupation = Television executive\n| title = \n| salary = 
\n| term = 2008–\n| predecessor = [[Janice Hadlow]]\n| successor = \u0022Incumbent\u0022\n| party =\n| boards =\n| religion =\n| spouse = Divorced\n| children = 1 daughter\n| relations =\n| website =\n| footnotes =\n}}\n\n\u0022'Richard Henry Klein\u0022' (born 12 October 1958) is the former controller of [[BBC Four]]. He became controller in 2008, taking over from [[Janice Hadlow]], who became Controller of [[BBC Two]].\n\n==Early life==\nHe was born in [[Burwash|Burwash Common]] in Sussex (now in [[East Sussex]]) to Hans Klein and Bernadine Thorne. He attended [[Prior Park College]], a Roman Catholic indepen
 from {{STN|Naoetsu}}
