February 2010 \n| Recorded       = 2009\n| Genre          = [[Hip hop music|Hip hop]], [[Hardcore hip hop]]\n| Length         = 3:26\n| Label          = [[E1 Music|E1]], [[Terror Squad (record label)|Terror Squad]]\n| Writer         = [[Fat Joe|Joseph Cartagena]],  [[Young Jeezy|Jay Jenkins]], [[Jazzie B|Trevor Beresford Romeo]]\n| Producer       = Scoop DeVille, Jonathan Nemr\n| Chronology     = [[Fat Joe]] singles\n| Last single    = \u0022[[Aloha (Fat Joe song)|Aloha]]\u0022\n(2009)\n| This single    = \u0022'\u0022(Ha Ha) Slow Down\u0022\u0022'\n(2010)\n| Next single    = \u0022[[If It Ain't About Money]]\u0022\n(2010)\n| Misc = {{Extra chronology\n| Artist = [[Young Jeezy]] singles\n| Type = singles\n| Last single = \u0022[[Put Your Hands Up (DJ Khaled song)|Put Your\nHands Up]]\u0022 \n(2010)\n| This single = \u0022\u0022'(Ha Ha) Slow Down\u0022'\u0022\n(2010)\n| Next single = \u0022[[Lose My Mind]]\u0022 \n(2010)\n}}}}\n\n\u0022\u0022'(Ha Ha) Slow Down\u0022'\u0022 is the first single from [[Fat Joe]]'s tenth [[studio album]] \u0022[[The Darkside Vol. 1]]\u0022. The song features rapper [[Young Jeezy]]. It also contains a short sample of [[Soul II Soul]]'s \u0022[[Back to Life (However Do You Want Me)]]\u0022 (a capella version)  throughout the entire beat.\n\n==Remixes==\nSeveral rappers have recorded freestyles over the song's instrumental, including [[The Lox]], [[Talib Kweli]], [[Shyne]], [[Jae Millz]], [[Game (rapper)|Game]], [[Rick Ross (rapper)|Rick Ross]], [[Nipsey Hussle]], [[Capone-N-Noreaga]], [[Raekwon]], Uncle Murda, [[Jim Jones (rapper)|Jim Jones]], and [[French Montana]]. More elements of \u0022Back to Life (However Do You Want Me)\u0022 are sampled on [[Maino]]'s version.\n\n==Music video==\nThe music video was produced by Parris and features a cameo by [[Sean Combs|Diddy]], [[Trina (rapper)|Trina]], Waah ([[Ruff Ryders Entertainment]] CEO) & [[Al Harrington]] (professional NBA player from the [[Denver Nuggets]]).\n\n==Charts==\n{| class=\u0022wikitable\u0022\n|-\n!Chart (2010)\n!Peak\nposition\n|-\n|U.S. \u0022Billboard\u0022 [[Hot R&B/Hip-Hop Songs]]\n| style=\u0022text-align:center;\u0022|54\n|-\n|U.S. \u0022Billboard\u0022 [[Rap Songs]]\n| style=\u0022text-align:center;\u0022|23\n|}\n\n==References==\n{{reflist}}\n\n{{Fat Joe}}\n{{Young Jeezy}}\n\n{{DEFAULTSORT:Ha Ha Slow Down}}\n[[Category:2009 songs]]\n[[Category:2010 singles]]\n[[Category:Fat Joe songs]]\n[[Category:Young Jeezy songs]]\n[[Category:Song recordings produced by Scoop DeVille]]\n[[Category:Songs written by Fat Joe]]\n[[Category:Songs written by Young Jeezy]]\n[[Category:Songs written by Jazzie B]]\n\n\n{{
-hiphop-single-stub}}</text>\n      <sha1>ehdhx6dkny5k9p3crqbkh3qa1mcw2il</sha1>\n    </revision>\n  </page>\n  <page>\n    <title>Category:Defunct utility companies of Australia</title>\n    <ns>14</ns>\n    <id>26885452</id>\n    <revision>\n      <id>733694423</id>\n      <parentid>474584417</parentid>\n      <timestamp>2016-08-09T14:21:43Z</timestamp>\n      <contributor>\n        <username>JarrahTree</username>\n        <id>278097</id>\n      </contributor>\n      <comment>add</comment>\n      <model>wikitext</model>\n      <format>text/x-wiki</format>\n      <text xml:space=\u0022preserve\u0022>[[Category:Defunct companies of Australia|Utility]]\n[[Category:Utility companies of Australia]]\n{{portal|Australia|Companies|Energy}}</text>\n      <sha1>36jznz6bb6z8mxz396sh18lzukgrsy3</sha1>\n    </revision>\n  </page>\n  <page>\n    <title>Pope of dope</title>\n    <ns>0</ns>\n    <id>26885463</id>\n    <redirect title=\u0022Timothy Leary\u0022 />\n    <revision>\n      <id>354838718</id>\n      <timestamp>2010-04-08T22:29:27Z</timestamp>\n      <contributor>\n        <username>Caramesc</username>\n        <id>22210
