)\n*[[Korpana]] (
)\n*[[Ballarpur]] (
),\n\nSome other villages along with Gadchandur in [[Korpana]] taluka are Antargaon Bk., Awalpur, Belgaon, Bharosa, Bhoyegaon, Bibi.\n\n==References==\n{{reflist}}\n\n\n==External links==\n*[http://www.onefivenine.com/india/villages/Chandrapur/Korpana/Gadchandur Gadchandur Village]\n\n[http://m.timesofindia.com/city/nagpur/NCP-wins-7-seats-in-first-Gadchandur-civic-polls/articleshow/45946957.cms]\n\n[[Category:Cities and towns in Chandrapur district]]</text>\n      <sha1>gqqhshjwjku1rv98jidnezrofck9o1p</sha1>\n    </revision>\n  </page>\n  <page>\n    <title>Petrus von Hatzfeld</title>\n    <ns>0</ns>\n    <id>33060960</id>\n    <revision>\n      <id>720514871</id>\n      <parentid>662732684</parentid>\n      <timestamp>2016-05-16T10:11:03Z</timestamp>\n      <contributor>\n        <username>KasparBot</username>\n        <id>24420788</id>\n      </contributor>\n      <comment>migrating [[Wikipedia:Persondata|Persondata]] to Wikidata, [[toollabs:kasparbot/persondata/|please help]], see [[toollabs:kasparbot/persondata/challenge.php/article/Petrus von Hatzfeld|challenges for this article]]</comment>\n      <model>wikitext</model>\n      <format>text/x-wiki</format>\n      <text xml:space=\u0022preserve\u0022>{{notability|Biographies|date=September 2011}}\n{{Expand German|date=September 2011|Petrus von Hatzfeld}}\n.]]\n\u0022'Petrus von Hatzfeld\u0022' (1748 in [[Münster]] - 24 April 1823 in Boesfeld, today in [[Herzebrock-Clarholz]]) was a German Roman Catholic priest and forty-eighth abbot of [[Marienfeld Abbey (Germany)|Marienfeld Abbey]].\n\n{{Authority control}}\n{{DEFAULTSORT:Hatzfeld}}\n[[Category:1748 births]]\n[[Category:1823 deaths]]\n[[Category:German abbots]]\n\n\n{{Germany-RC-clergy-stub}}</text>\n      <sha1>dll8yg6xz7f47isfyfmw7x1v4r8ptso</sha1>\n    </revision>\n  </page>\n  <page>\n    <title>Yepcalphis dilectissima</title>\n    <ns>0</ns>\n    <id>33060969</id>\n    <revision>\n      <id>733348242</id>\n      <parentid>621454843</parentid>\n      <time