[India\n| language       = [[Malayalam Language|Malayalam]]\n}}\n\n\u0022\u0022'Swapnam\u0022\u0022' is a [[Malayalam films of 1973|1973]] [[Cinema of India|Indian]] [[Malayalam language|Malayalam]] film, directed by [[Babu Nanthankode]] and produced by Sivan. The film stars [[Madhu (actor)|Madhu]], [[Nanditha Bose]], [[Sudheer (Malayalam actor)|Sudheer]] and [[Jose Prakash]] in lead roles. The film had musical score by [[Salil Chowdhary]].\n\n==Cast==\n{{colbegin}}\n*[[Madhu (actor)|Madhu]] as Viswanathan\n*[[Nanditha Bose]] as Gauri\n*[[Sudheer (Malayalam actor)|Sudheer]] as Bindu\n*[[Jose Prakash]]\n*[[Adoor Bhavani]]\n*[[Aranmula Ponnamma]] as Viswanathan's Mother\n*Aryad Gopalakrishnan\n*[[Balan K Nair]]\n*[[Kottarakkara Sreedharan Nair]]\n*Radhamani\n*[[Rani Chandra]]\n{{colend}}\n\n==Soundtrack==\nThe music was composed by [[Salil Chowdhary]] and lyrics was written by [[ONV Kurup]].\n\n{| class=\u0022wikitable\u0022\n|- bgcolor=\u0022#CCCCCF\u0022 align=\u0022center\u0022\n| \u0022'No.\u0022' || \u0022'Song\u0022' || \u0022'Singers\u0022' ||\u0022'Lyrics\u0022' || \u0022'Length (m:ss)\u0022'\n|-\n| 1 || Maane Maane || [[K. J. Yesudas]] || [[ONV Kurup]] || \n|-\n| 2 || Mazhavilkodi(Kaanakkuyile) || [[S Janaki]] || [[ONV Kurup]] || \n|-\n| 3 || Nee Varu Kaavyadevathe || [[K. J. Yesudas]] || [[ONV Kurup]] || \n|-\n| 4 || Shaarike En Shaarike || [[S Janaki]] || [[ONV Kurup]] || \n|-\n| 5 || Sourayoodhathil || [[Vani Jairam]] || [[ONV Kurup]] || \n|}\n\n==References==\n{{reflist}}\n\n==External links==\n* {{IMDB title|0278077|Swapnam}}\n\n[[Category:1973 films]]\n[[Category:Indian films]]\n[[Category:
 Malayalam-language films]]\n\n{{
-Malayalam-film-stub}}</text>\n      <sha1>iniytkmv1kh7xsql3h9ilgj3v34vvqp</sha1>\n    </revision>\n  </page>\n  <page>\n    <title>Mazhakaaru</title>\n    <ns>0</ns>\n    <id>31156452</id>\n    <revision>\n      <id>691813503</id>\n      <parentid>689414273</parentid>\n      <timestamp>2015-11-22T09:48:59Z</timestamp>\n      <contributor>\n        <ip>117.247.202.212</ip>\n      </contributor>\n      <model>wikitext</model>\n      <format>text/x-wiki</format>\n      <text xml:space=\u0022preserve\u0022>{{Use dmy dates|date=November 2015}}\n{{Use Indian English|date=November 2015}}\n{{Infobox film \n| name           = Mazhakaaru\n| image          =\n| caption        =\n| director       = [[P. N. Menon (director)|P. N. Menon]]\n| producer       = SK Nair\n| writer         = G Vivekanandan\n[[Thoppil Bhasi]] (dialogues)\n| screenplay     = [[Thoppil Bhasi]]\n| starring       = [[Madhu (actor)|Madhu]]\n[[Kanakadurga]]\n[[Roja Ramani]]\n[[KPAC Lalitha]]\n| music          = [[G. Devarajan]]\n| cinematography = [[Ashok Kumar (cinematographer)|Ashok Kumar]]\n| editing        = Ravi\n| studio         = New India Films\n| distributor    = Thirumeni Pictures\n| released       = {{Film date|1973|08|03|df=y}}\n| country        = [[India]]\n| language       = [[Malayalam Language|Malayalam]]\n}}\n\n\u0022\u0022'Mazhakaaru\u0022\u0022' is a [[Malayalam films of 1973|1973]] [[Cinema of India|Indian]] [[Malayalam language|Malayalam]] film, directed by [[P. N. Menon (director)|P. N. Menon]] and produced by SK Nair. The film stars [[Madhu (actor)|Madhu]], [[Kanakadurga]], [[Roja Ramani]] and [[KPAC Lalitha]] in lead roles. The film had musical score by [[G. Devarajan]].<ref>{{cite web|url=http://malayalasangeetham.info/m.php?930|title=Mazhakkaaru|accessdate=2014-10-15|publisher=malayalasangeetham.info}
